<section class="hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Terms</span><h1>Website terms.</h1><p>General terms for use of the ATRS Engineering Consultants website.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container prose"><h2>Informational use</h2><p>Website content is provided for general information about ATRS services and experience. It should not be treated as project-specific engineering advice without a formal engagement and review of the relevant project information.</p><h2>Project information</h2><p>Project pages distinguish documented ATRS assignments from key-personnel experience. Published figures, dates and roles should be read in the context of the evidence available to ATRS.</p><h2>External links</h2><p>Where the site links to external resources, ATRS is not responsible for the content or availability of those third-party websites.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about the website can be sent to <a href="mailto:info@atrseng.co.ke">info@atrseng.co.ke</a>.</p></div></section>
